{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_3_level_main_03-07_end",
  "groupId": "main_3",
  "stageId": "main_03-07",
  "title": "轰鸣",
  "storyCode": "3-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a9ee202e687841fe2634d10fa55fd9b47179b25cc2363c5de7b66a0cb8e70af5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十九关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能让他们过去！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W应该带走米莎了——————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能让这些家伙得逞！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——给我让开！别急着寻死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，呃啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，哦哦......这么粗暴的作战方式，让我想起了罗德岛的一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她和星熊长官大概，大概会很有共同话题吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要光站在那里，芙兰卡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快做点什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，龙门的督察传说看来是真的啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别分心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没光是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在看别人哦！砰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "废墟二楼的那些火力小组，可是我发现的哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很棒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能让雇主孤身奋战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙兰卡，有没有找到米莎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到处都没有她的踪迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W可能，已经把她带走了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，动作也太快了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪里发生了......爆炸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙兰卡，集合各个小队，支援近卫局！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局队员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛的各位，千万小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局队员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个敌人，它，它......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局队员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——发生什么了？为什么不说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敌人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......咦？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎，怎么会......!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，这是什么把戏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是奇迹，奇迹啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别发呆！找掩体！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇迹发生了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————是你吗......是你吗！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——他没事！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他，他没事啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "碎骨还活着！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "碎骨！真的是碎骨！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "万岁！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......难道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合运动......因为领袖的出现士气大振了吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要拿下他们变得更难了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......形势很严峻，碎骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但至少......你回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——太好了......真的......太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米莎她也应该离开了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样，我们就能放手一搏了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我会在这里，挡住他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们，快走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会保护你们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说什么呢碎骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们不是早说过，要一起回乌萨斯，给那些家伙点颜色看看吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好照顾自己，别死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愣在那做什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊，立刻向外围的近卫局成员发出通讯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陷阱和埋伏已经基本被我方排除，没有发现敌方领袖W和任务目标的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，更改作战目标！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "立刻收拢包围圈，合力夹击整合运动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......为什么会这样......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
